From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:15:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] soc: apple: mailbox: Match the A7-A8X ANS mailbox

The A7-A8X ANS mailbox has the same FIFO, mask and message packing as
the A7 IOP mailbox that is already supported, so match its generic
compatible to that variant instead of carrying a separate 64-bit AKF
implementation.

[Orchard: replaces Hoolock's AKF mailbox series (HoolockLinux/linux ans1 ed8528f a9683d122ab2,
b055d938b01a, 26f606f7aa9f, 4cfff10fc213) by Nick Chan on this stack.]
Signed-off-by: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/soc/apple/mailbox.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/apple/mailbox.c b/drivers/soc/apple/mailbox.c
index cd27fb666..75aa1b2d0 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/apple/mailbox.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/apple/mailbox.c
@@ -553,6 +553,8 @@ static const struct of_device_id apple_mbox_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "apple,asc-mailbox-v4", .data = &apple_mbox_asc_hw },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,t8015-asc-mailbox", .data = &apple_mbox_t8015_hw },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,t8010-a7iop-mailbox", .data = &apple_mbox_a7iop_hw },
+	/* A7-A8X ANS/AKF coprocessors: same FIFO, mask and packing layout as A7IOP */
+	{ .compatible = "apple,akf-mailbox-v1", .data = &apple_mbox_a7iop_hw },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,m3-mailbox-v2", .data = &apple_mbox_m3_hw },
 	{}
 };
